From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mason Morris <masonmorris8@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 03:24:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/10] Add a render observer to AudioContext

AudioContext::set_render_observer() hands an observer every callback's
output samples, its render time and budget, and the render time of each
quantum it rendered, on the render thread. Quanta are timed only while an
observer is set. It lets an embedder record what the device receives and
watch for underruns without a second output path.
